[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546838898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2546838898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2546838898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xza1y","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T21:30:02Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T21:30:02Z","body":"CI needs to use a newer Emscripten for this to build, so this won't pass CI until after PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100482 is merged","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546838898/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546851319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2546851319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2546851319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xzd33","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T21:34:34Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T21:34:34Z","body":"I'll try to see what they mean by JS macros here:\n\nhttps://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/22510","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546851319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546877298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2546877298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2546877298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XzkNy","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T21:44:26Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T21:44:26Z","body":"> I'll try to see what they mean by JS macros here:\r\n> \r\n> [emscripten-core/emscripten#22510](https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/22510)\r\n\r\nOh, interesting! I think they're talking about the preprocessor macros used throughout Emscripten's JS library code, like `#if ASSERTIONS`. I had thought that those all corresponded to settings (ie `-s` arguments like `-sASSERTIONS`, also defined in `settings.js`), but if we can define our own macrcos, we could use that to have different code for different Emscripten versions\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546877298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546919292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2546919292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2546919292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xzud8","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T22:00:17Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T22:00:17Z","body":"Linked from the issue Adam pointed to above, someone claimed to have success using a macro like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n#if EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION.split('.').map(parseFloat)[0] < 3 || (EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION.split('.').map(parseFloat)[0] == 3 && EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION.split('.').map(parseFloat)[1] < 1) || (EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION.split('.').map(parseFloat)[0] == 3 && EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION.split('.').map(parseFloat)[1] == 1 && EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION.split('.').map(parseFloat)[2] < 71)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAside from being pretty terrible, it didn't actually work me. :-/ That seems to compile fine with 3.1.74, but I get an error (with no error message) when trying with 3.1.64.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2546919292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2547127922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2547127922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2547127922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6X0hZy","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T23:33:31Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T23:33:31Z","body":"I created some macros to use in `library_godot_webxr.js`. Here's the diff.\r\n\r\nNote that I just compiled successfully in 3.1.64 and 3.1.74. I didn't test if my fix worked (i.e. open a WebXR project).\r\n\r\n<details markdown=1>\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/modules/webxr/native/library_godot_webxr.js b/modules/webxr/native/library_godot_webxr.js\r\nindex 40400272bf..3130e73ea2 100644\r\n--- a/modules/webxr/native/library_godot_webxr.js\r\n+++ b/modules/webxr/native/library_godot_webxr.js\r\n@@ -29,7 +29,24 @@\r\n /**************************************************************************/\r\n \r\n const GodotWebXR = {\r\n-\t$GodotWebXR__deps: ['$MainLoop', '$GL', '$GodotRuntime', '$runtimeKeepalivePush', '$runtimeKeepalivePop'],\r\n+\t$GodotWebXR__deps: [\r\n+#if EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_SMALLER_THAN(3,1,71)\r\n+\t\t'$Browser',\r\n+#else \r\n+\t\t'$MainLoop',\r\n+#endif\r\n+\t\t'$GL', \r\n+\t\t'$GodotRuntime', \r\n+\t\t'$runtimeKeepalivePush', \r\n+\t\t'$runtimeKeepalivePop'\r\n+\t],\r\n+\t$GodotWebXR__postset: `\r\n+#if EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_SMALLER_THAN(3,1,71)\r\n+\t\tGodotWebXR.mainLoop = Browser;\r\n+#else \r\n+\t\tGodotWebXR.mainLoop = MainLoop;\r\n+#endif\r\n+\t`,\r\n \t$GodotWebXR: {\r\n \t\tgl: null,\r\n \r\n@@ -44,6 +61,8 @@ const GodotWebXR = {\r\n \t\ttouches: new Array(5),\r\n \t\tonsimpleevent: null,\r\n \r\n+\t\tmainLoop: null,\r\n+\r\n \t\t// Monkey-patch the requestAnimationFrame() used by Emscripten for the main\r\n \t\t// loop, so that we can swap it out for XRSession.requestAnimationFrame()\r\n \t\t// when an XR session is started.\r\n@@ -64,9 +83,9 @@ const GodotWebXR = {\r\n \t\t},\r\n \t\tmonkeyPatchRequestAnimationFrame: (enable) => {\r\n \t\t\tif (GodotWebXR.orig_requestAnimationFrame === null) {\r\n-\t\t\t\tGodotWebXR.orig_requestAnimationFrame = MainLoop.requestAnimationFrame;\r\n+\t\t\t\tGodotWebXR.orig_requestAnimationFrame = GodotWebXR.mainLoop.requestAnimationFrame;\r\n \t\t\t}\r\n-\t\t\tMainLoop.requestAnimationFrame = enable\r\n+\t\t\tGodotWebXR.mainLoop.requestAnimationFrame = enable\r\n \t\t\t\t? GodotWebXR.requestAnimationFrame\r\n \t\t\t\t: GodotWebXR.orig_requestAnimationFrame;\r\n \t\t},\r\n@@ -76,11 +95,11 @@ const GodotWebXR = {\r\n \t\t\t// enabled or disabled. When using the WebXR API Emulator, this\r\n \t\t\t// gets picked up automatically, however, in the Oculus Browser\r\n \t\t\t// on the Quest, we need to pause and resume the main loop.\r\n-\t\t\tMainLoop.pause();\r\n+\t\t\tGodotWebXR.mainLoop.pause();\r\n \t\t\truntimeKeepalivePush();\r\n \t\t\twindow.setTimeout(function () {\r\n \t\t\t\truntimeKeepalivePop();\r\n-\t\t\t\tMainLoop.resume();\r\n+\t\t\t\tGodotWebXR.mainLoop.resume();\r\n \t\t\t}, 0);\r\n \t\t},\r\n \r\ndiff --git a/platform/web/SCsub b/platform/web/SCsub\r\nindex 9a2eea9e07..15ba28c131 100644\r\n--- a/platform/web/SCsub\r\n+++ b/platform/web/SCsub\r\n@@ -33,6 +33,7 @@ if env[\"target\"] == \"editor\":\r\n     env.add_source_files(web_files, \"editor/*.cpp\")\r\n \r\n sys_env = env.Clone()\r\n+sys_env.AddJSLibraries([\"js/libs/library_godot_macros.js\"], prepend=True)\r\n sys_env.AddJSLibraries(\r\n     [\r\n         \"js/libs/library_godot_audio.js\",\r\ndiff --git a/platform/web/emscripten_helpers.py b/platform/web/emscripten_helpers.py\r\nindex 6a3855da84..dbb8143a85 100644\r\n--- a/platform/web/emscripten_helpers.py\r\n+++ b/platform/web/emscripten_helpers.py\r\n@@ -115,8 +115,11 @@ def get_template_zip_path(env):\r\n     return \"#bin/.web_zip\"\r\n \r\n \r\n-def add_js_libraries(env, libraries):\r\n-    env.Append(JS_LIBS=env.File(libraries))\r\n+def add_js_libraries(env, libraries, prepend=False):\r\n+    if prepend:\r\n+        env.Prepend(JS_LIBS=env.File(libraries))\r\n+    else:\r\n+        env.Append(JS_LIBS=env.File(libraries))\r\n \r\n \r\n def add_js_pre(env, js_pre):\r\ndiff --git a/platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_macros.js b/platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_macros.js\r\nnew file mode 100644\r\nindex 0000000000..76f3ca9e79\r\n--- /dev/null\r\n+++ b/platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_macros.js\r\n@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@\r\n+{{{\r\n+\tglobalThis.___EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_PARSED = globalThis.EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION.split(\".\").map((n) => parseInt(n));\r\n+\r\n+\tglobalThis.___SEMVER_IS_GREATER_THAN = (a, b, { orEqual = false } = {}) => {\r\n+\t\tconst [aMajor, aMinor, aPatch] = a;\r\n+\t\tconst [bMajor, bMinor, bPatch] = b;\r\n+\t\tif ((orEqual && aMajor >= bMajor) || aMajor > bMajor) {\r\n+\t\t\tif ((orEqual && aMinor >= bMinor) || aMinor > bMinor) {\r\n+\t\t\t\tif ((orEqual && aPatch >= bPatch) || aPatch > bPatch) {\r\n+\t\t\t\t\treturn true;\r\n+\t\t\t\t}\r\n+\t\t\t}\r\n+\t\t}\r\n+\t\treturn false;\r\n+\t};\r\n+\r\n+\tglobalThis.EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_GREATER_THAN = (major, minor, patch) => {\r\n+\t\tconst isGreater =  globalThis.___SEMVER_IS_GREATER_THAN(globalThis.___EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_PARSED, [major, minor, patch]);\r\n+\t\treturn isGreater;\r\n+\t};\r\n+\r\n+\tglobalThis.EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUAL = (major, minor, patch) => {\r\n+\t\tconst isGreaterOrEqual = globalThis.___SEMVER_IS_GREATER_THAN(globalThis.___EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_PARSED, [major, minor, patch], { orEqual: true });\r\n+\t\treturn isGreaterOrEqual;\r\n+\t};\r\n+\r\n+\tglobalThis.EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_SMALLER_THAN = (major, minor, patch) => {\r\n+\t\tconst isGreaterOrEqual = globalThis.___SEMVER_IS_GREATER_THAN(globalThis.___EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_PARSED, [major, minor, patch], { orEqual: true });\r\n+\t\treturn !isGreaterOrEqual;\r\n+\t};\r\n+\r\n+\tglobalThis.EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_SMALLER_THAN_OR_EQUAL = (major, minor, patch) => {\r\n+\t\tconst isGreater = globalThis.___SEMVER_IS_GREATER_THAN(globalThis.___EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_PARSED, [major, minor, patch]);\r\n+\t\treturn !isGreater;\r\n+\t};\r\n+}}}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2547127922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2547454349","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2547454349","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2547454349,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6X1xGN","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-17T03:57:55Z","updated_at":"2024-12-17T03:58:09Z","body":"@adamscott Thanks! I added your patch with some slight modifications to get it working, and it _is_ working for me with both Emscripten 3.1.64 and 3.1.74. However, `eslint` hates it (at least locally) and so I expect this will fail the static checks. I'm not sure if we can get `eslint` to understand these JS preprocessor macros?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2547454349/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2547909796","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2547909796","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2547909796,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6X3gSk","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-17T09:20:57Z","updated_at":"2024-12-17T11:45:27Z","body":"I took the liberty to add a commit to your PR. It adds an eslint processor to filter out C preprocessors. (yo dawg)\r\n\r\nI also renamed `EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_SMALLER_THAN` to `EMSCRIPTEN_VERSION_IS_LESS_THAN`. More appropriate.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2547909796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2548260369","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100489#issuecomment-2548260369","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100489","id":2548260369,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6X414R","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://a